  "claim": "borg_parse_aux() queues every monster spell line as SPELL_nnn and returns (borg-messages.c:636-658), so the Lunal-off test at borg-messages.c:1281-1289 (which also uses prefix() on lines that start with the monster's name) never runs. borg_update() now clears borg.lunal_mode when it handles a SPELL_ reaction for RSF_TELE_TO or RSF_TELE_AWAY. With Lunal mode off, borg_flow_stair_more() applies its preparedness filter (borg-flow-stairs.c:196) and refuses the descent; with it on, the filter is skipped.",
